    {
      "text": "Why do some people wear expensive watches?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that's an interesting question. I don't think I would buy an expensive watch even if I were rich, but maybe it's an identity symbol, you know? Like how some girls buy luxury bags. I think expensive watches are the same thing for some men — a way to show their status. And I've also heard that some rich people buy expensive watches and jewelry because if something bad happens, they can just grab them and run — they're portable, and worth more than gold by volume. So maybe that's a reason too.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 2.94,
      "end": 26.04
    }
